  "title": "Exterior Painting Portfolio – The Proud Paintbrush",
  "metaDescription": "Explore our exterior painting portfolio with full-home exteriors, stucco, brick, siding, limewash finishes, fences, and decks. Real examples of durable",
  "h1": "Exterior Painting Portfolio",
  "bodyHtml": "<img src=\"/images/migrated/bright-stucco-home-painting-sugar-land-portfolio.webp\" alt=\"Freshly painted crisp white and black two-story stucco home exterior in Sugar Land by The Proud Paintbrush\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"eager\"><h2>Exterior Painting Portfolio</h2><p><strong>Residential Exterior Projects | The Proud Paintbrush</strong></p><p>Our exterior painting portfolio highlights completed projects that showcase durable finishes, consistent preparation, and attention to detail across a wide range of exterior surfaces.</p><p>These examples help homeowners see how our exterior work improves curb appeal while protecting homes from weather, moisture, and long-term wear.</p><h2>Exterior Painting Projects</h2><p>Below are examples of exterior painting projects completed by The Proud Paintbrush, including:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/exterior-painters\">Full exterior repaints</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/stucco-maintenance/stucco-painting\">Stucco, brick, and siding painting</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/brick-painting\">Limewash brick finishes</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/garage-door-painting\">Garage doors</a> and exterior trim</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/exterior-painting/fence-staining\">Fence </a>and <a href=\"/exterior-painting/deck-painting-and-staining\">deck staining</a></p></li><li><p>Patio ceilings and outdoor living spaces</p></li></ul><p>Each project reflects our focus on surface preparation, proper product selection, and clean execution.</p><h2>What You’ll Notice in Our Exterior Work</h2><p>As you browse our exterior portfolio, pay attention to:</p><ul><li><p>Even coverage and consistent color</p></li><li><p>Clean lines on trim and architectural details</p></li><li><p>Proper preparation on stucco, brick, and siding</p></li><li><p>Finishes designed to hold up to sun and moisture</p></li><li><p>A cohesive, finished look across the entire exterior</p></li></ul><p>These details are what allow exterior paint to perform well over time instead of failing prematurely.</p><h2>Looking for More Details About Exterior Painting?</h2><p>If you’d like to learn more about our exterior painting process, materials, or what to expect during a project, you can explore the page below.</p><p><a href=\"/painting-services/exterior-painting\">→ <strong>Explore Exterior Painting Services</strong></a></p><h2>Project Gallery</h2><p>Completed exterior projects, grouped by color.</p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:10px;margin:1.5rem 0;\"><figure style=\"margin:0;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;border-radius:8px;background:#f3f4f6;\"><img width=\"720\" height=\"403\" src=\"/images/migrated/thumbs/fence2-175128.webp\" alt=\"Exterior painting project by The Proud Paintbrush in Fort Bend County, TX\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;margin:0;border-radius:0;box-shadow:none;\"></figure><figure style=\"margin:0;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;border-radius:8px;background:#f3f4f6;\"><img width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"/images/migrated/thumbs/photo-2023-03-29-17-46-20.webp\" alt=\"Exterior painting project by The Proud Paintbrush in Fort Bend County, TX\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;margin:0;border-radius:0;box-shadow:none;\"></figure><figure style=\"margin:0;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;border-radius:8px;background:#f3f4f6;\"><img width=\"720\" height=\"540\" src=\"/images/migrated/thumbs/fence-staining-sugar-land-the-proud-paintbrush-1.webp\" alt=\"Side yard exterior refresh including fence staining and surface detailing, improving durability and creating a clean, finished look along the property line\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;margin:0;border-radius:0;box-shadow:none;\"></figure><figure style=\"margin:0;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;border-radius:8px;background:#f3f4f6;\"><im